    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Do This:\r\n1.  Try out the three **Pure Methods**. Look at the values in the `originalData` array and the `newData` array. What do you notice?\r\n2.  Click **Reset**, then try out the different **Mutating Methods** and note the values in the arrays.\r\n3.  **In your activity guide:** How does the `originalData` array behave differently for the Pure methods compared to the Mutating methods?",
